        </svg>
        <span>32 Free Official Papers • Grades 1 to 12 • 6 Subjects</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        Free Olympiad <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF2E93] to-[#EA0264] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Question Bank</span> & Sample Papers
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">
